    "text": "explore venango\nwebsite\nPennsylvania\n$258 Million in Property Tax/Rent Rebates Headed to Pennsylvanians\nBy Kyle Ochs,\n1 days agoHARRISBURG, Pa. (EYT) — Yesterday, Governor Josh Shapiro and Secretary of Revenue Pat Browne visited the East Shore YMCA in Dauphin County to announce that rebates on property taxes and rent paid in 2024 as part of the Property Tax/Rent Rebate (PTRR) program will start to be distributed today, July 1, 2025, as required by law.\n3",
